DESCRIPTION:Event interval: Ongoing event\nAccessibility Contact: uwcibe
 r@uw.edu\nEvent Types: Academics\,Conferences\,Special Events\nEvent spo
 nsors: <a href="https://foster.uw.edu/centers/gbc/undergraduate/" target
 ="_blank" dir="ltr">Global Business Center</a>\nLink: https://foster.uw.
 edu/centers/gbc/competitions/#riicc\n\nRIICC 2026 - Team Registration Cl
 oses\nCompete in the Foster School of Business\, Global Business Center'
 s (GBC) annual Russell Investments International Case Competition (RIICC
 ): \nhttps://foster.uw.edu/centers/gbc/competitions/#riicc on November 1
 4\, 2026!\n\nTeams of four UW undergraduate students (with at least one 
 Foster major) will tackle a global business challenge over 72 hours. Tea
 ms receive the case on November 10 and present their recommendations to 
 Seattle business professionals on Saturday\, November 14\, 2026.\n\nRIIC
 C is a great introduction to case competitions\, featuring a global busi
 ness theme\, 72 hours to develop a solution\, a case competition prep wo
 rkshop\, opportunities to meet with coaches before the final presentatio
 n\, and the chance to network with students and professionals. Cash priz
 es are also available for top teams!\n\nTeam Registration Closes: Octobe
 r 26\, 2026\nOpen to all UW undergraduate students on the UW Seattle cam
 pus.
